  - "Con c\u1EA7n 2 g\xF3i m\xEC v\xE0 1 ly n\u01B0\u1EDBc m\xEDa \u1EA1"
  - "\u01A0 \xE9o gi\xFAp th\xEC th\xF4i, ch\xFA tu\u1ED5i!!!"
  - "Ch\xE1u v\u1EC1 m\xE9c m\xE1, huhuhu"
  - "\u0110\u1ED3 \u0103n c\u1EE7a ch\xE1u \u0111\xE2u \u1EA1?"
  - "\xD4i c\u1EA3m \u01A1n ch\xFA!"
  - "Ch\xE1u g\u1EEDi ch\xFA ti\u1EC1n \u1EA1"
